sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>(TLS edge)
    participant FE as frontend<br/>nginx + React
    participant BE as backend<br/>Quarkus
    participant GW as casual<br/>gateway inbound :7771
    participant CF as casual<br/>catfacts server
    participant UC as casual<br/>casual/example/uppercase
    participant API as catfact.ninja

    User->>Route: GET /api/fact (HTTPS)
    Route->>FE: GET /api/fact
    FE->>BE: proxy GET /api/fact
    BE->>GW: tpcall catfacts/random (empty X_OCTET)
    GW->>CF: catfacts/random
    CF->>API: GET https://catfact.ninja/fact
    API-->>CF: 200 {"fact":"...","length":n}
    CF->>UC: casual_service_forward<br/>casual/example/uppercase
    UC-->>GW: fact text upper-cased (X_OCTET)
    GW-->>BE: reply buffer
    BE-->>FE: 200 {"fact":"CAT FACT TEXT"}
    FE-->>Route: 200 JSON
    Route-->>User: 200 JSON
    Note over User: Tile shows the fact
